    {
      "id": "v4-notes",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 2720,
      "width": 1472,
      "height": 48,
      "text": "Scope: request routing and replica control. The Deployment groups managed Pods; it is not a proxy in the request path.\nThe Service and branch dots express logical selection, not extra running proxies. Namespace does not imply network isolation.",
