      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Scope: request routing and replica control. The Deployment groups managed Pods; it is not a proxy in the request path.\nThe Service and branch dots express logical selection, not extra running proxies. Namespace does not imply network isolation."
    },
    {
      "id": "v4-legend",
